## Engineering update

- **Shared parser — fixed:** Engineering changed the parser to read DD/MM for EU locales.
- **Booking-v3 hint — won't fix:** Engineering retired the booking-v3 form.

The desk closed #4471 on 5 October. The table also flags reports that the desk read as a one-day move but filed by tenant under a cause. Review those reports individually; a month/day swap does not by itself explain a one-day difference.

The subject-only duplicate rule can merge different causes and split matching causes across tickets. Read the reports and tenant details when triaging; the accepted decision record remains unchanged.

